# The LV2 plugins zynthian enables by default, as far as they are packaged: Alpine's packages and
# the ones in nura/lv2/. State and plan: docs/nura-lv2-plugins.md (zynthian-ui). The SoundFont
# instruments (fluidplug-lv2, avldrums-lv2: about 450 MB of data) are optional, not in here.
